        "title": {
          "en": "New Benchmark Addresses LLM Model Fusion Evaluation Gaps",
          "zh": "新基准解决大型语言模型融合评估空白"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Researchers introduced FusionEval, a new benchmark designed to assess model fusion for Large Language Models by providing controlled expert pools and integrating various fusion methods.",
          "zh": "研究人员推出了FusionEval，这是一个旨在评估大型语言模型融合的新基准，通过提供受控专家池并整合多种融合方法。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Existing evaluations offer limited coverage of reasoning with long chains of thought.",
            "Current benchmarks underrepresent tool use in model fusion assessments.",
            "FusionEval integrates fusion methods both with and without additional training."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "现有评估对长链思维推理的覆盖范围有限。",
            "当前基准在模型融合评估中对工具使用的代表性不足。",
            "FusionEval集成了有额外训练和无额外训练的融合方法。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This benchmark aims to provide a more comprehensive and unified evaluation of model fusion techniques for LLMs, potentially leading to more robust single models integrated from multi-expert capabilities.",
          "zh": "该基准旨在为大型语言模型的模型融合技术提供更全面和统一的评估，可能有助于从多专家能力中整合出更稳健的单一模型。"
        },
        "source": "arXiv CS.CL",
        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.30162"
      },
